{"text": "Every afternoon, the children played in the Giant's beautiful garden. One day, the Giant came home. 'My garden is my garden!' he shouted, and the children ran away. He built a high wall around it, and winter stayed in his garden all year. One morning, the children climbed in through a hole in the wall, and spring came back! The Giant smiled and gently lifted a little boy into a tree, which burst into flowers. Then he knocked down the wall. 'It is your garden now, little children,' he said.", "words": [[0.4, 0.7], [0.7, 1.48], [1.55, 1.7], [1.7, 2.19], [2.19, 2.59], [2.59, 2.66], [2.66, 2.79], [2.79, 3.38], [3.38, 3.94], [3.94, 4.66], [6.01, 6.23], [6.23, 6.51], [6.55, 6.67], [6.67, 7.09], [7.09, 7.36], [7.36, 7.91], [8.09, 8.25], [8.25, 8.71], [8.71, 8.86], [8.86, 9.12], [9.12, 9.81], [9.91, 10.08], [10.08, 10.61], [10.65, 10.75], [10.75, 10.86], [10.86, 11.36], [11.36, 11.61], [11.61, 12.19], [13.54, 13.67], [13.67, 13.94], [13.94, 14.06], [14.06, 14.43], [14.43, 14.74], [14.74, 15.14], [15.14, 15.37], [15.44, 15.6], [15.6, 16.07], [16.07, 16.45], [16.45, 16.53], [16.53, 16.69], [16.69, 17.22], [17.22, 17.5], [17.5, 18.01], [19.36, 19.58], [19.58, 19.93], [19.97, 20.1], [20.1, 20.56], [20.56, 20.87], [20.87, 21.07], [21.07, 21.31], [21.31, 21.42], [21.42, 21.79], [21.79, 21.9], [21.9, 22.02], [22.02, 22.61], [22.72, 22.91], [22.91, 23.36], [23.36, 23.66], [23.66, 24.24], [25.59, 25.7], [25.7, 26.19], [26.19, 26.8], [26.8, 26.95], [26.95, 27.37], [27.37, 27.7], [27.7, 27.77], [27.77, 28.07], [28.07, 28.42], [28.42, 28.68], [28.68, 28.79], [28.79, 29.34], [29.41, 29.69], [29.69, 30.15], [30.15, 30.44], [30.44, 31.26], [32.61, 32.78], [32.78, 32.93], [32.93, 33.28], [33.28, 33.52], [33.52, 33.65], [33.65, 34.31], [34.46, 34.64], [34.64, 34.79], [34.79, 35.01], [35.01, 35.48], [35.48, 35.71], [35.75, 36.06], [36.06, 36.59], [36.66, 36.87], [36.87, 37.38]], "scenes": [0.0, 5.61, 13.14, 18.96, 25.19, 32.21], "tag": "kokoro:bf_alice"}